      "text": "# The dsh-plugin-browser-use bundle patch: one insert adding the browser tool\n# plugin row over the profile's existing layers (e.g. dsh-base). Later layers\n# and the user's profile cordis.patch.yml can target this row by id `browser`\n# (last write wins per row).\n#\n# A Chromium is required at runtime: bring your own via the `executablePath`\n# config or $DSH_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE, or rely on Playwright's installed browser.\n# Defaults below mirror the plugin's schema defaults; restate any row here only\n# to change it for every profile that adds this bundle.\n\n- insert:\n    - id: browser\n      name: 'dsh-plugin-browser-use'\n"
    }
